{"id":12482,"first_release_date":1455494400,"genres":[{"id":9,"name":"Puzzle"},{"id":31,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":32,"name":"Indie"}],"involved_companies":[{"id":201423,"company":{"id":4598,"name":"Bloober Team"},"developer":true,"publisher":true},{"id":270949,"company":{"id":36477,"name":"EXNOA LLC"},"developer":true,"publisher":false}],"name":"Layers of Fear","storyline":"Set in the years after World War I, the story follows a troubled painter who returns to his eerie Victorian mansion determined to complete his magnum opus. As he wanders the ever-shifting halls in search of the materials he needs, the house warps and rearranges around him, defying spatial logic and dredging up fragments of his past. Piece by piece, letters, objects, and haunting flashbacks reveal the tragedy that befell his wife and family and the toll it has taken on his fracturing mind.","summary":"Layers of Fear is a psychedelic horror that will keep you on-edge for the reminder of the game. Delve deep into the mind of an insane painter and discover the secret of his madness, as you walk through a constantly shifting house.

Heavily inspired by the masterpiece paintings from the past centuries, and the architecture and décor from the XIX century. Layers of Fear is a truly unique experience, where each move of the camera can change your surroundings.

Layer by layer uncover the visions, fears and horrors that entwine the protagonist and finish the masterpiece he has strived so long to create.","total_rating":73.47339775089301,"url":"https://www.igdb.com/games/layers-of-fear"}

{"id":4969,"first_release_date":1352764800,"genres":[{"id":31,"name":"Adventure"}],"involved_companies":[{"id":11983,"company":{"id":23,"name":"Feral Interactive"},"developer":false,"publisher":true},{"id":19866,"company":{"id":292,"name":"Traveller's Tales"},"developer":true,"publisher":false},{"id":292815,"company":{"id":1290,"name":"TT Fusion"},"developer":false,"publisher":false},{"id":292814,"company":{"id":50,"name":"WB Games"},"developer":false,"publisher":true}],"name":"LEGO The Lord of the Rings","storyline":"In LEGO The Lord of the Rings, the hobbit Frodo is entrusted with a dangerous task: to destroy an ancient magical ring that threatens all that is good. Join him and his friends as they are forced to leave their peaceful homes, in search of guidance and aid. But the Ring wants to be found....and the road to Mount Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed, is riddled with Orcs...and fouler things.","summary":"Based on The Lord of the Rings motion picture trilogy, LEGO The Lord of the Rings follows the original storylines of The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring, The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers, and The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King, taking players through the epic story events reimagined with the humor and endless variety of LEGO play.

Trusted with the dangerous task to destroy an ancient magical ring that threatens all that is good, Frodo is forced to leave his peaceful home. But the ring wants to be found and the road to Mount Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed, will be perilous and riddled with Orcs and fouler things.

To help Frodo, a Fellowship is formed —Aragorn the Ranger, Gandalf the Wizard, Legolas the Elf, Gimli the Dwarf, Boromir a Man of Gondor, and Frodo’s Hobbit friends Sam, Merry and Pippin. Players relive the legend through the LEGO minifigures, as they explore wonders, solve timeless riddles, and overcome endless foes in their quest to destroy the Ring.","total_rating":76.17476124176756,"url":"https://www.igdb.com/games/lego-the-lord-of-the-rings"}

{"id":350903,"first_release_date":1760054400,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Platform"},{"id":9,"name":"Puzzle"},{"id":31,"name":"Adventure"}],"involved_companies":[{"id":326783,"company":{"id":2390,"name":"Engine Software"},"developer":false,"publisher":false},{"id":400665,"company":{"id":747,"name":"Tarsier Studios"},"developer":true,"publisher":false},{"id":400664,"company":{"id":248,"name":"Bandai Namco Entertainment"},"developer":false,"publisher":true}],"name":"Little Nightmares: Enhanced Edition","storyline":"Little Nightmares follows Six, a small, raincoat-clad child trapped in a mysterious underwater vessel called the Maw. The Maw is inhabited by grotesque, monstrous residents who prey on the helpless. As Six navigates through disturbing environments, she must solve puzzles and avoid being captured. The journey gradually reveals the dark and oppressive nature of the Maw and its inhabitants. Driven by hunger and desperation, Six’s actions ultimately reflect the cycle of predation within the world she inhabits.","summary":"Little Nightmares is a puzzle-platform horror adventure game developed by Tarsier Studios and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Set in a mysterious world, Little Nightmares follows the journey of Six, a hungry little girl who must escape the Maw, an iron vessel inhabited by monstrous, twisted beings.

The Enhanced Edition improves upon the original release by supporting 4K resolution at 60 FPS and enhancing visual effects, including RTX reflections, improved water effects, additional particles, and volumetric lighting.

It also offers players the option to choose between Quality Mode or Performance Mode, allowing them to prioritize either visual fidelity or frame rate based on their preferences.","total_rating":80.0025379368175,"url":"https://www.igdb.com/games/little-nightmares-enhanced-edition"}

