{"id":27116,"first_release_date":1486425600,"genres":[{"id":31,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":32,"name":"Indie"}],"involved_companies":[{"id":44232,"company":{"id":12077,"name":"ION LANDS"},"developer":true,"publisher":true}],"name":"Phoning Home","summary":"You play ION, a young exploration unit on a mission to secure natural resources. When you crash-land on an alien planet your ship is almost completely destroyed. Not only do you have to survive in a strange new world full of dangers, but to have even a hope of escape you must find a way to contact your home planet for help.

