{"id":191692,"first_release_date":1685664000,"genres":[{"id":4,"name":"Fighting"},{"id":33,"name":"Arcade"}],"involved_companies":[{"id":405083,"company":{"id":37,"name":"Capcom"},"developer":false,"publisher":true},{"id":405084,"company":{"id":42454,"name":"Capcom Development Division 2"},"developer":true,"publisher":false}],"name":"Street Fighter 6","storyline":"Discover the meaning of strength in World Tour, an immersive, single-player story mode. Take your avatar and explore Metro City and beyond. Meet Masters who will take you under their wing and teach you their style and techniques.","summary":"The evolution of fighting games starts with our traditional Fighting Ground, and then we're turning the genre on its head with World Tour and Battle Hub for a total of three modes where anyone can play to their liking.

